        "parts": [
          {
            "text": "```json\n{\n  \"findings\": [\n    {\n      \"clauseType\": \"Anti-Assignment\",\n      \"characterization\": \"QUALIFIED\",\n      \"quote\": \"Berkshire may not assign this Agreement, in whole or in part, without Auriemma's written consent. In the case of reorganization, merger, consolidation, or sale of all or substantially all of its assets, any attempt to assign this Agreement other than as permitted above will be null and void.\",\n      \"overrideQuote\": \"The License Rights are exclusive to Berkshire and may not be assigned or in any way conveyed by Berkshire without Auriemma's express written consent, except in the event of a merger by Berkshire with another entity offering Banking Services.\",\n      \"note\": \"While Berkshire generally cannot assign the agreement without written consent, Section 2(c) creates an express exception allowing assignment/conveyance of License Rights upon a merger with another entity offering Banking Services, and Section 22 permits Auriemma to assign monetary benefits.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseType\": \"Change Of Control\",\n      \"characterization\": \"ABSOLUTE\",\n      \"quote\": \"For the purposes of this Agreement, a transaction in which the ultimate beneficial ownership of a party remains substantially unchanged, including any internal reorganisation, recapitalisation, or transaction effected solely to alter the jurisdiction of incorporation of that party, does not constitute a change of control, an acquisition, or a transfer of control of that party. The rights and obligations arising under this Agreement upon a change of control have no application to any such transaction.\",\n      \"overrideQuote\": null,\n      \"note\": \"The continuity of ownership provision specifies that internal reorganizations or transactions where beneficial ownership remains substantially unchanged do not trigger change-of-control rights or obligations, with no conflicting limitations elsewhere in the contract.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseType\": \"Exclusivity\",\n      \"characterization\": \"QUALIFIED\",\n      \"quote\": \"Auriemma will not enter into any arrangement or agreement, which enables any Berkshire Competitor to be endorsed by Auriemma (whether by using the Auriemma Identification, Auriemma providing services similar to the Endorsement Services, or otherwise) during the Contract Period within the Contract Territory.\",\n      \"overrideQuote\": \"Notwithstanding the foregoing, it is understood that Auriemma has no control or influence over any decisions by the University of Connecticut to enter into any arrangement or agreement with any Berkshire Competitor.\",\n      \"note\": \"Auriemma's exclusivity covenant is qualified by an express carveout regarding any arrangements or agreements entered into by the University of Connecticut with a Berkshire competitor.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```",
